# Production config lives in Firebase App Hosting, not in this file.
#   - Secrets (MONGODB_URI, JWT_SECRET, MFA_ENCRYPTION_KEY): Cloud Secret Manager,
#     set with `firebase apphosting:secrets:set <NAME>` and wired in apphosting.yaml.
#   - Plain values (STORAGE_BUCKET): apphosting.yaml `env:`.
#   - NODE_ENV and PORT are set by App Hosting / Cloud Run.
# This file is not deployed (see firebase.json "ignore") and not tracked in git.
#
# Seed scripts (scripts/seed-*.mjs) read ADMIN_* / PLATFORM_ADMIN_* — put those
# in a local .env.local only when seeding, then remove them.
